o express my views regarding the financial, educational, and welfare-related activities of the institution."}],["$","p","Aai Ramai Social and Educational Institution has been established with the objective of working towards the development of the weaker and underprivileged sections of society, as well as in the areas of education, healthcare, women’s welfare, and social awareness. Through the institution, we intend to undertake various social and educational initiatives for the overall development and welfare of the community.",{"children":"Aai Ramai Social and Educational Institution has been established with the objective of working towards the development of the weaker and underprivileged sections of society, as well as in the areas of education, healthcare, women’s welfare, and social awareness. Through the institution, we intend to undertake various social and educational initiatives for the overall development and welfare of the community."}],["$","p","As the Treasurer, it will be my primary responsibility to maintain transparency, honesty, and accountability in all financial transactions of the institution. I will always make sincere efforts to ensure that all financial dealings are conducted properly and transparently, in accordance with the objectives of the institution and all applicable rules and regulations.",{"children":"As the Treasurer, it will be my primary responsibility to maintain transparency, honesty, and accountability in all financial transactions of the institution. I will always make sincere efforts to ensure that all financial dealings are conducted properly and transparently, in accordance with the objectives of the institution and all applicable rules and regulations."}],["$","p","With the cooperation and support of all office-bearers, members, and well-wishers of the institution, I am fully confident that we will successfully achieve our objective of serving and upholding the values of Aai Ramai Devi and working towards the progress and welfare of society.",{"children":"With the cooperation and support of all office-bearers, members, and well-wishers of the institution, I am fully confident that we will successfully achieve our objective of serving and upholding the values of Aai Ramai Devi and working towards the progress and welfare of society."}],["$","p","With transparency in our actions, honesty in our intentions, and unity in our efforts, we can build an institution that truly serves society.",{"children":"With transparency in our actions, honesty in our intentions, and unity in our efforts, we can build an institution that truly serves society."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"page_profileNav__nX0Dg","aria-label":"Committee members","children":[["$","$L2","trustee",{"href":"/people/trustee","className":"","children":["Trustee",["$","$L3",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M7 7h10v10","key":"1tivn9"}],["path",{"d":"M7 17 17 7","key":"1vkiza"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":16,"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L2","president",{"href":"/people/president","className":"","children":["President",["$","$L3",null,{"iconNode":"$4","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":16,"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L2","secretary",{"href":"/people/secretary","className":"","children":["Secretary",["$","$L3",null,{"iconNode":"$4","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":16,"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L2","treasurer",{"href":"/people/treasurer","className":"page_active__Ac53n","children":["Treasurer",["$","$L3",null,{"iconNode":"$4","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":16,"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/852c753457a26c78.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]]],null],null]},[null,["$","$L9",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","people","children","$a","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$Lb",null,{}],"temp